olated from my primary strategy of building a Character-based hand around the W5-W6-W7 concentration. With only one T4 and no other Bamboo tiles, it provides no synergy. Discarding T4 maintains my focus on developing the W-suit melds (potential for W7 pung, W5-W6-W7 or W3-W4-W5 chows) while working toward Half Flush or better scoring patterns with my existing J1 pung.\n\nAnswer: Play T4"}
